      },
      "message": "Remove Smaiae extension riscv#622\n\nThe AIA spec describes a minimal implementation of mvip and mvien, which does not carry a significant area penalty. The Smaiae section is removed, and a Smaclic/Ssaclic section \"Area impact of AIA features\" explains how area can be reduced when needed.",
